WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.420
Profiles: the right access
for the work in hand.

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.319
See your master profile, make
smaller profiles for a region,

3
00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:10.709
a state and a county,
and switch between them.

4
00:00:12.287 --> 00:00:14.255
Sky works for EPA Region 3.

5
00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:19.065
The profile box in the header shows
the profile in use: right now,

6
00:00:19.065 --> 00:00:20.850
the master profile.

7
00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:25.039
Work queues shows tasks from
every state in the region,

8
00:00:25.039 --> 00:00:27.593
from Delaware to West Virginia.

9
00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:31.594
Select the profile box
to open My profiles.

10
00:00:31.951 --> 00:00:35.989
The master profile is everything
your administrator gave you:

11
00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:39.764
Supervisor at EPA Region
3 and everything under it.

12
00:00:40.122 --> 00:00:45.393
A profile is a smaller copy of it,
like a day key cut from a master key.

13
00:00:45.393 --> 00:00:48.429
It can open fewer doors, never more.

14
00:00:48.786 --> 00:00:55.275
First, a profile that sees every state
in the region but cannot change anything,

15
00:00:55.275 --> 00:00:58.190
for reviews and screen sharing.

16
00:00:58.548 --> 00:01:02.856
Each grant is a place, a
role and an access level.

17
00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:07.563
Choose EPA Region 3, and
keep everything under it.

18
00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:10.425
Set the access to read only.

19
00:01:10.787 --> 00:01:15.704
Beside the form is your master
profile, the most a profile can have.

20
00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:19.431
MERIT refuses to save
one that goes beyond it.

21
00:01:19.789 --> 00:01:21.774
Save the profile.

22
00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:26.637
Next, a profile for all of Maryland.

23
00:01:27.924 --> 00:01:30.251
Choose Maryland as the place.

24
00:01:30.251 --> 00:01:35.546
Everything under it, including
Harford County, comes with it.

25
00:01:35.931 --> 00:01:40.527
Read and write without delete lets you
work normally while protecting records

26
00:01:40.527 --> 00:01:42.061
from being deleted.

27
00:01:42.732 --> 00:01:47.329
Last, a profile for a day
of Harford County work.

28
00:01:48.912 --> 00:01:54.322
Choose the Harford County Health
Department, with full access, and save.

29
00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:02.588
My profiles now lists the master
profile and the three new ones,

30
00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.802
each with what it gives you.

31
00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.242
To switch, choose Use beside a profile.

32
00:02:08.242 --> 00:02:12.489
MERIT changes straight
away, without signing out.

33
00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:18.992
The header now shows Maryland only, and
Work queues lists just the Maryland tasks,

34
00:02:18.992 --> 00:02:21.181
Harford County included.

35
00:02:21.546 --> 00:02:27.200
Switch to Harford County only, and
only the Harford County task is left.

36
00:02:28.153 --> 00:02:32.167
With the read-only regional
profile, every state is back.

37
00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:36.089
Intake, which adds records,
is gone from the menu.

38
00:02:36.732 --> 00:02:39.732
You can go back to your
master profile at any time:

39
00:02:39.732 --> 00:02:42.072
choose Use beside Master profile.

40
00:02:43.386 --> 00:02:48.618
In this video you saw that the master
profile holds everything you were given,

41
00:02:48.618 --> 00:02:53.314
made profiles for every Region 3
state read only, for all of Maryland,

42
00:02:53.314 --> 00:02:58.412
and for Harford County, and switched
between them and saw Work queues follow

43
00:02:58.412 --> 00:02:59.812
the profile.
